//! IEEE Std 802.1AB-2016 §8.1: an LLDPDU is a sequence of TLVs, each opening with
//! a 7-bit type and a 9-bit length in one 16-bit word, ending at the End Of LLDPDU
//! TLV (type 0). §8.5 gives the mandatory Chassis ID, Port ID and Time To Live
//! TLVs and the optional ones. EtherType 0x88CC is the IEEE 802.1AB assignment.
